sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant A as Shopping agent<br/>/api/agent-nexus/ucp/agent
    participant P as Business profile<br/>/.well-known/ucp
    participant B as Checkout API<br/>/api/agent-nexus/ucp/checkout-sessions
    V->>A: RunAgentInput (AG-UI 1.0): the wish
    A->>P: GET the profile
    P-->>A: services, checkout capability, sandbox_pay
    A->>B: create_checkout (UCP-Agent, Idempotency-Key)
    B-->>A: 201 incomplete, priced from the catalogue
    A-->>V: tool calls, reasoning, the priced checkout
    Note over A,B: complete_checkout is proposed, not sent
    A-->>V: RUN_FINISHED: interrupt "Approve this order"
    V->>A: resume: approved, email
    A->>B: update_checkout (buyer.email)
    B-->>A: ready_for_complete
    A->>B: complete_checkout, exactly as approved
    B-->>A: completed, order (sandbox, no payment)
    A-->>V: tool result, RUN_FINISHED: success
